# Per-business private data (each user fills their own; example* are committed demos)
businesses/*
!businesses/README.md
!businesses/example
!businesses/example/**
!businesses/example-prelaunch
!businesses/example-prelaunch/**
# Secrets
**/secrets.env
# Runtime
*.lock
**/state/KILL

# Runtime logs (per-business)
**/logs/
# Waitlist contains personal data - never commit, even for demos
**/state/waitlist.jsonl
